        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jada Pinkett Smith, Mila Kunis, Kristen Bell, Kathryn Hahn, Jay Hernandez, Annie Mumolo, Christina Applegate\n- Films: Bad Moms\n- Television: True Colors\n- Roles: actress, dancer, singer-songwriter, businesswoman\n\nFacts:\n- Jada Koren Pinkett-Smith was born on September 18, 1971, and she is an American actress, dancer, singer-songwriter, and businesswoman.\n- Jada Pinkett Smith began her career in 1990 with a guest appearance in the short-lived sitcom \"True Colors\".\n- The film \"Bad Moms\" stars an ensemble cast that includes Mila Kunis, Kristen Bell, Kathryn Hahn, Jay Hernandez, Annie Mumolo, Jada Pinkett Smith, and Christina Applegate.",
